the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  05 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 15 53 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number are three parts  Labeled  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 5cm breast with an irregular shape REMOVED_DATE x 15 0cm fragment of skin containing an unremarkable REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm nipple  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm ill defined white to tan firm mass on the lateral aspect of the breast 0 3cm from the closest  anterior  superficial  resection margin and 2 0cm from the closest deep resection margin  Immediately lateral to the main mass is an ill defined REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm white  fibrous area abutting the anterior  superficial resection margin  The remaining breast parenchyma is mostly fatty and unremarkable  Section code  A B and C  tumor with closest anterior superficial resection margin D  tumor with skin E  tumor  br report_end  , No.
